  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'Ah! Thank you for finding it my son ! It is one of the greatest treasures
      of our church ! '
  - speaker: 0
    text: "It\u2019s a relic so close to our lord. How did you get it ?"
  - speaker: 1
    text: Let's say that a child ... ended up bringing it to us.
  - speaker: 0
    text: ' I hope she has been gracefully rewarded !'
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'She would have been if she had brought it directly to the temple. '
  - speaker: 1
    text: Unfortunately, she chose to obey only her own interest.
  - speaker: 0
    text: 'And... what happened to the child ?  '
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'Just go see the miscreant at the end of the garden, she will tell you. '
